This project is an independent community port and reconciliation of bridge behavior
from EdgeTypE/dsh-better-deepseek for DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.2.

Original project: https://github.com/EdgeTypE/dsh-better-deepseek
Related browser extension: https://github.com/EdgeTypE/better-deepseek

The port preserves the public bridge contract while updating package identity,
compatibility metadata, request validation, and documentation. This project is
not an official DeepSeek or Better DeepSeek release.
